# A recorded `act --json` stream, one JSON object per line.
#
# Recorded from the real `changes` job running under the harness in
# docs/local-validation-of-github-actions-with-act-and-pytest.md, then
# reduced to the events the parser reads. Fields no parser touches and
# that vary per machine or per run — `time`, `msg`, `jobID`, `executionTime`
# and the container paths inside `msg` — are dropped, so the file is
# deterministic and diffs cleanly.
#
# Lines starting with `#` are not part of the format; the test strips them.
#
# the detector-failure path: the detector step fails, so `bench` is never set.
#
